Upstream project: https://github.com/adgad/kboard
Upstream documentation: https://github.com/adgad/kboard/blob/master/README.md
and https://github.com/adgad/kboard/wiki
F-Droid page for the upstream app: https://f-droid.org/en/packages/com.adgad.kboard/

The imported baseline is upstream commit 2660fb108f4bd48438e822fdfc2ead1fdf5805ae,
version 5.3.0, message "bump version number". The command language, most of
the keyboard, and the original command notes come from that project. Later
changes in this repository are additions. This repository does not claim the
original keyboard as new work.

The application id com.adgad.kboard.plus is the Android package name. It is
kept so an update replaces the previous install of this app and keeps its data.
It is not a separate product name.
